#. i18n: file: croppage.ui:25
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KIPIPrintImagesPlugin::CropFrame, cropFrame)
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:213
#| msgid ""
#| "Move the box to crop photos to fit inside the photo sizes you have "
#| "given.  \n"
#| "You can crop each image differently, or just click 'Next' button to use "
#| "the default crop \n"
#| "setting for each photo.\n"
#| "Enable \"Don't crop\" to avoid cropping all the photos."
msgid ""
"Move the box in order to crop photos so that they fit inside the photo sizes "
"you have given.  \n"
"You can crop each image differently, or just click the 'Next' button to use "
"the default crop \n"
"setting for each photo.\n"
"Enable \"Do not crop\" to avoid cropping all of the photos."
msgstr ""
"Mova a caixa para recortar as fotos de xeito que encaixen nos tamaños de foto "
"que forneceu. \n"
"Pode recortar cada imaxe de xeito diferente ou simplemente premer o botón "
"«Seguinte» para empregar a configuración de recorte\n"
"por omisión para cada foto.\n"
"Active «Non recortar» para evitar recortar todas as fotos."

